# What `gcloud builds submit` may upload from a working copy: only what the two Dockerfiles copy. The platform's images
# are built from the linked repository at a commit (cloudbuild.yaml); this keeps a local submit, should one be needed,
# from carrying anything else, a local configuration or state file above all.
*
!Dockerfile.cloudinfra
!Dockerfile.appdelivery
!requirements.lock
!pip.lock
!cloudinfra/
!cloudinfra/**
!appdelivery/
!appdelivery/**
**/__pycache__/
